<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(This section describes the general factors that influence the Digital Notes Management System and its requirements. It explains the product\220s background, main functions, user characteristics, constraints, assumptions, and its relationship to external systems. This section does not include detailed requirements, which are provided in later sections.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[1]>>
