<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(The system is intended to operate on modern web browsers \(Chrome, Safari, Edge\) and mobile devices running iOS or Android. A stable internet connection is required for cloud synchronization and real-time collaboration. The system operates conceptually without a deployed backend server due to project constraints.)/E(The system is intended to operate on modern web browsers \(Chrome, Safari, Edge\) and mobile devices running iOS or Android. A stable internet connection is required for cloud synchronization and real-time collaboration. The system operates conceptually without a deployed backend server due to project constraints.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

