endobj

297 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1179 0 R/E(Platform Constraints: Cloud synchronization is hypothetical and not linked to an actual server for this academic project.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

298 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1180 0 R/E(Security Constraints: Must follow basic security practices such as password encryption and user authentication.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

299 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1181 0 R/E(Regulatory Constraints: Must comply with data privacy principles\204no sharing of personal data without permission.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

300 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1182 0 R/E(Interface Limitations: System interacts only with conceptual cloud services and no external APIs are implemented.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[14]>>
