endobj

305 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1185 0 R/E(Users have basic digital literacy and familiarity with note-taking tools.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

306 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1186 0 R/E(Cloud services \(hypothetical\) are available and functional for syncing.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[20]>>
endobj

307 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1187 0 R/E(Users will use up-to-date browsers or mobile devices.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[21]>>
endobj

308 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1188 0 R/E(The system depends on a stable backend database structure for storing users and notes.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

309 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1189 0 R/E(Real-time collaboration assumes that all users maintain an active connection.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[23]>>
endobj

310 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Any changes to these assumptions \(like loss of internet, lack of cloud support, or outdated devices\) may impact the system\220s performance or requirements.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[24]>>
